%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec4ba6a512adabf4b8a74985cb2f4d14, type: 3}
  m_Name: SoldierDay1Dialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptedDialogue
  nodes:
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Oh, fantastic. Another fresh inspector. Did they pull you straight out
      of the academy, or did you just get lost on the way to a real posting?
    animationTrigger: TalkCocky
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Three tours. I've done the real thing. Every checkpoint, same scene —
      clean uniform, that little hopeful look. You all have it. You all lose it.
    animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: So what exactly did they prepare you for? Go on, be honest.
    animationTrigger: TalkSarcasticNod
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: The basics. Enough to do the job.
      npcResponse: The basics. Right. That'll keep you breathing for maybe forty-eight
        hours. Maybe.
      animationTrigger: TalkDismissing
    - playerChoiceText: Guess we'll find out.
      npcResponse: Ha. I'll give you credit for not lying to my face. Doesn't change
        anything — you won't last.
      animationTrigger: TalkShrug
  - type: 0
    npcLine: I'll be generous. Three days. Four if nothing interesting shows up. And
      it will.
    animationTrigger: TalkDismissing
    cameraTrigger: LookUp
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Last guy they put here gave me that same look you're giving me now. Two
      weeks in, he saw something he couldn't explain. Tried to flag it. Nobody listened.
      After that, neither did he.
    animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: So settle in, Inspector. Put your little stamp on things. Make it feel
      like you're in control, because that's all this is — a feeling. And out here
      that feeling goes away fast, before you—
    animationTrigger: TalkPoint
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
